#. Plugin Name of the plugin
msgid "Gift Vouchers for Amelia"
msgstr ""

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
msgid "https://github.com/glx77/gift-vouchers-for-amelia"
msgstr ""

#. Description of the plugin
msgid ""
"Sell gift vouchers for your Amelia services through WooCommerce. Each paid "
"order automatically generates a single-use 100% Amelia coupon restricted to "
"the purchased service."
msgstr ""
"Vendez des bons cadeaux pour vos services Amelia via WooCommerce. Chaque "
"commande payée génère automatiquement un coupon Amelia 100% à usage unique, "
"restreint au service acheté."

#. Author of the plugin
msgid "Glow with Lilou"
msgstr ""

